      "content": "i hear you but i'm just so stressed about the hospital thing. my friend had something similar and it turned out to be just a massive migraine and she was fine after some meds. if i wait a few hours to see if the drooping goes away on its own, is that really gonna make a huge difference? like, can i just try some dark room and maybe some magnesium to see if it settles down first? i really feel like i can manage this at home.",
